    "type": "markdown_header",
    "content": "A journey into RGB",
    "prefix": "#"
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "In this program, we will delve deeply into RGB, a revolutionary multi-layer solution for Bitcoin scalability. RGB employs client-side validation to integrate its smart contracts into Bitcoin, allowing for off-chain contracts and scalable use cases of the protocol. From DeFi to NFTs to asset creation, RGB is a promising technology that can enable many new uncensorable use cases."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "In this course, we will first focus on the theoretical aspects, then explore the programming side, and finally, we will look at some concrete real-life examples and exercises. The course originates from a live seminar organized by Fulgur'Ventures and taught by three renowned teachers and RGB experts."
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Enjoy and good luck with one of the most advanced topics in Bitcoin."
  },
