  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "A big thanks to the person who've organized this live courses and the 3 teachers who've participated:"
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "content": "Maxim Orlovsky : Ex Tenebrae sententia sapiens dominabitur astris. Cypher, AI, robotics, transhumanism. Creator of RGB, Prime, Radiant and lnp_bp, mycitadel_io & cyphernet_io",
    "prefix": "-",
    "indent": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "content": "Hunter trujilo :  Developer, Rust, Bitcoin, Bitcoin, Lightning, RGB",
    "prefix": "-",
    "indent": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "content": "Federico Tenga : Doing my part to make the world become a cypherpunk dystopia. Currently working on RGB at @bitfinex",
    "prefix": "-",
    "indent": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": "Good luck with your studies, and if you need to reach out to our team or the teacher, please use the appropriate channel. This course will be updated shortly with a text section for each chapter, exams and image. stay tuned."
  },
